---
import "./series-visual.css";
---

<figure
  class="interaction-flow series-visual not-prose"
  aria-labelledby="interaction-flow-title"
>
  <p id="interaction-flow-title" class="figure-title">
    用户操作怎样进入运行，运行进展怎样返回？
  </p>
  <section class="layer">
    <strong>用户界面</strong>
    <span>接收输入与中断操作，显示回答和工具状态</span>
  </section>
  <div class="connections">
    <span>↓ 提交要求、请求中断</span>
    <span>↑ 回答、活动状态、排队提示</span>
  </div>
  <section class="layer control">
    <strong>交互与运行控制 · 本篇重点</strong>
    <div class="responsibilities">
      <span>运行状态<br />现在能否开始新运行</span>
      <span>输入队列<br />追加要求何时处理</span>
      <span>取消控制<br />通知停止并等待收尾</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="connections">
    <span>↓ 启动运行、提供追加输入、传递取消信号</span>
    <span>↑ 运行事件、停止原因或异常</span>
  </div>
  <section class="layer">
    <strong>Agent 执行</strong>
    <span>runner 准备运行 → Agent 循环调用模型与工具</span>
  </section>
  <figcaption>
    职责示意。交互层可以在等待执行完成期间继续接收操作；具体界面布局与渲染见第
    07 篇。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .interaction-flow {
    margin: 1.8rem 0;
    color: var(--series-ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    container-type: inline-size;
  }
  .figure-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .layer {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--series-rule);
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
  }
  .layer > strong,
  .layer > span {
    display: block;
  }
  .layer > strong {
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .layer > span {
    color: var(--series-secondary);
  }
  .control {
    border-color: var(--series-blue);
    background: var(--series-blue-wash);
  }
  .responsibilities {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .responsibilities span {
    border: 1px solid var(--series-blue);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: var(--series-paper);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
  }
  .connections {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .connections span:first-child {
    color: var(--series-blue);
  }
  .connections span:last-child {
    color: var(--series-feedback);
  }
  figcaption {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--series-secondary);
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 540px) {
    .responsibilities,
    .connections {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .connections {
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
